        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVBELCOM, Fifth Avenue Entry Lever Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <a href=\"/products/bellagio-lever-with-fifth-avenue-plate-grandeur-favbel\">Fifth Avenue's Long Plate</a> and matching <a href=\"/products/fifth-avenue-deadbolt-grandeur-favfav-db\">Fifth Avenue Deadbolt</a>, combined with the Bellagio Lever's simple lines draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. Unencumbered by complexity, this clean contemporary design is unique in decorative door hardware. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Single Cylinder Fifth Avenue Entry Set With Bellagio Lever fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Fifth Avenue Entry Door Lever Lock Set:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Fifth Avenue Entry Set With Bellagio Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Height: 7.17\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 3.46\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-plate.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BEL-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Bellagio Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
